{
  "version": "2026-04-24",
  "name": "feishu_interactive_08_conclusion",
  "description": "正式版 08 结论 interactive card 模板。用于阶段收口、阶段结论同步与下一步确认。",
  "message_type": "conclusion",
  "message_code": "08",
  "label": "结论",
  "msg_type": "interactive",
  "card": {
    "config": {
      "wide_screen_mode": true,
      "enable_forward": true
    },
    "header": {
      "template": "green",
      "title": {
        "tag": "plain_text",
        "content": "{title_prefix}｜08 结论"
      },
      "subtitle": {
        "tag": "plain_text",
        "content": "阶段结论 · {task_name}"
      }
    },
    "elements": [
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**✦ 阶段概览**\n阶段名称｜{task_name}\n当前责任人｜{owner_mention}\n收口抄送｜{closer_mentions}\n阶段状态｜{status}\n结论目标｜{goal}"
      },
      {
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**◈ 阶段结论**\n1. {judgement_1}\n2. {judgement_2}\n3. {judgement_3}"
      },
      {
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**◔ 当前状态**\n当前状态｜{status}\n下一节点｜{next_milestone}\n需确认事项｜{decision_note}"
      },
      {
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**☰ 下一步动作**\n{actions_md}"
      },
      {
        "tag": "hr"
      },
      {
        "tag": "markdown",
        "content": "**receipt｜**以回读与 mention 验证为准。"
      }
    ]
  },
  "default_values": {
    "closer_mentions": "Hermes_CEO",
    "decision_note": "无"
  },
  "business_sections": {
    "actions": {
      "render_key": "actions_md",
      "legacy_prefix": "action_item_",
      "max_items": 3,
      "required": true
    }
  },
  "required_placeholders": [
    "title_prefix",
    "task_name",
    "owner_mention",
    "goal",
    "judgement_1",
    "judgement_2",
    "judgement_3",
    "status",
    "next_milestone",
    "actions_md"
  ]
}
